# Note: intent:* ids are placeholders here to match the spirit of
# INTENT-REGISTRY-ROADMAP and CONTEXTHUB-SPEC. They can be promoted to
# first-class [[entity]] id = "intent:..." when the registry is modeled.

# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Usage
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file can be:
# - Loaded as a governed knowledge source in the platform model
# - Lowered into DESIRE entities + relations
# - Projected by ContextHub for intent-linked docs + code
# - Used to drive "nearby code/docs" surfaces and LLM context packs
#
# See:
# - docs/CONTEXTHUB-SPEC.md (docNode, contextLink, implements, explains)
# - docs/INTENT-REGISTRY-ROADMAP.md
# - plugins/platform/platform-model.js (current inferred doc nodes & edges)
# - docs/intent/ (the 12 category files + tree that this models)
